Project Overview
This project predicts whether a customer is a good or bad credit risk using Machine Learning techniques. The model is built using a Decision Tree Classifier and helps financial institutions make informed lending decisions.
Dataset Information
The dataset contains customer information such as:
Checking Balance
Loan Duration
Credit History
Loan Purpose
Loan Amount
Savings Balance
Employment Status
Personal Information
Other Financial Attributes
Dataset Size:
Rows: 1000
Columns: 21
Technologies Used
Python
Pandas
NumPy
Matplotlib
Seaborn
Scikit-Learn
Jupyter Notebook
